    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344830/extras/92f98f82294399ccb8dcceff01d53ab3.avif?t=1716062366\" /></span><br><br>Ethereal: Requiem of Repose is an interactive point-and-click adventure. Follow a moody orphan's journey to unveil forgotten memories and cure her illness. Questions arise as young Valerie Alton becomes fast friends with Susie, a mysterious girl she has seen in her dreams. Accompanied by her undead caregiver Theria, Valerie must keep her secrets and loved ones close. She will come to find that her familial history, as well as her connection with Susie, go deeper than she once thought.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344830/extras/29ef8107bc128ec0ca78a93a98a2b155.avif?t=1716062366\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully animated, voice-acted cutscenes<br></li><li>A world full of interactive objects and people<br></li><li>Outfit customization<br></li><li>Side objectives<br></li><li>Impactful decisions</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344830/extras/92f98f82294399ccb8dcceff01d53ab3.avif?t=1716062366\" /></span><br><br>Ethereal: Requiem of Repose is an interactive point-and-click adventure. Follow a moody orphan's journey to unveil forgotten memories and cure her illness. Questions arise as young Valerie Alton becomes fast friends with Susie, a mysterious girl she has seen in her dreams. Accompanied by her undead caregiver Theria, Valerie must keep her secrets and loved ones close. She will come to find that her familial history, as well as her connection with Susie, go deeper than she once thought.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2344830/extras/29ef8107bc128ec0ca78a93a98a2b155.avif?t=1716062366\" /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Fully animated, voice-acted cutscenes<br></li><li>A world full of interactive objects and people<br></li><li>Outfit customization<br></li><li>Side objectives<br></li><li>Impactful decisions</li></ul>",
